     "section": "vec3 sp = vec3(0.0);\nvec3 dir = vec3(0.0, 0.0, 1.0);\nvec3 worldDir = normalize((vec4(dir, 0.0) * i_v0).xyz + vec3(0.0, 0.0, 1e-6));\nattributes.position = (vec4(sp, 1.0) * i_v0).xyz;\nattributes.velocity = worldDir * 0.0 * 1.0;\nattributes.lifetime = max(0.12, 0.0001);\nattributes.startColor = vec4(1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0);\nattributes.startSize = vec3(mix(0.8, 1.1, Rand(attributes.seed)));\nattributes.angle = vec3(0.0, 0.0, mix(-0.2617994, 0.2617994, Rand(attributes.seed)));",
