     "section": "float dt = u_DeltaTime;\nfloat t = clamp(attributes.age / attributes.lifetime, 0.0, 1.0);\nfloat ageBefore = attributes.age;\nvec3 positionBefore = attributes.position;\nattributes.position += (attributes.velocity + vec3(0.0)) * dt;\nbool collided = false;\nattributes.age += dt;\nif (attributes.age >= attributes.lifetime) attributes.alive = false;",
